# Copied to dist/.vercelignore by `npm run web:deploy`.
# The Vercel CLI ignores every path containing `node_modules` by default.
# `expo export --platform web` emits the icon fonts to
# dist/assets/node_modules/@expo/vector-icons/... — without this negation those
# files are silently dropped from the upload and every icon 404s on the
# deployed build (the local `serve dist` run looks fine, which hides it).
!node_modules
